      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolDescription": "Use this tool to search the company's Returns & Refunds Policy document. Call it whenever the customer asks about:\n- Returning a product\n- Refund eligibility, amount, or timeline\n- Exchange policy\n- Damaged, defective, or wrong item received\n- Cancellation of an order\n- Deadlines or conditions for returns (e.g. \"how many days do I have to return this\")\n\nDo NOT use this tool for questions about pricing, product features, shipping times, or anything unrelated to returns/refunds — those are outside the current knowledge base and should be flagged for human escalation instead.\n\nInput: the customer's question or a concise paraphrase of what they want to know.\nOutput: relevant excerpts from the Returns & Refunds Policy.",
